  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The code directly follows the idea.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2320,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 70,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Start with answer equals zero.",
      "start_ms": 2940,
      "end_ms": 5900,
      "start_frame": 88,
      "end_frame": 177,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Now choose every possible starting index.",
      "start_ms": 6400,
      "end_ms": 9020,
      "start_frame": 192,
      "end_frame": 271,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "For each new start, reset running underscore sum to zero.",
      "start_ms": 9560,
      "end_ms": 14000,
      "start_frame": 287,
      "end_frame": 420,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Then move end from start to the end of the array.",
      "start_ms": 14480,
      "end_ms": 17880,
      "start_frame": 434,
      "end_frame": 536,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "For every value, add nums end to the running sum.",
      "start_ms": 18560,
      "end_ms": 22200,
      "start_frame": 557,
      "end_frame": 666,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "And if that running sum equals k, increase the answer.",
      "start_ms": 22740,
      "end_ms": 26320,
      "start_frame": 682,
      "end_frame": 790,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the complete method.",
      "start_ms": 26920,
      "end_ms": 28780,
      "start_frame": 808,
      "end_frame": 863,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Two loops and one running sum.",
      "start_ms": 28780,
      "end_ms": 32260,
      "start_frame": 863,
      "end_frame": 968,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Now complexity.",
      "start_ms": 32840,
      "end_ms": 33640,
      "start_frame": 985,
      "end_frame": 1009,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "For the first start, we may inspect about n values.",
      "start_ms": 34200,
      "end_ms": 37740,
      "start_frame": 1026,
      "end_frame": 1132,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "For the next start, about n minus one, then n minus two and so on.",
      "start_ms": 38220,
      "end_ms": 43880,
      "start_frame": 1147,
      "end_frame": 1316,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "So the total work grows like n squared.",
      "start_ms": 44520,
      "end_ms": 47240,
      "start_frame": 1336,
      "end_frame": 1417,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Time complexity.",
      "start_ms": 48000,
      "end_ms": 48960,
      "start_frame": 1440,
      "end_frame": 1469,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "O of n squared for auxiliary space.",
      "start_ms": 49700,
      "end_ms": 52440,
      "start_frame": 1491,
      "end_frame": 1573,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "We only use a few variables.",
      "start_ms": 52980,
      "end_ms": 54500,
      "start_frame": 1589,
      "end_frame": 1635,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "So auxiliary space is O of one.",
      "start_ms": 55080,
      "end_ms": 57980,
      "start_frame": 1652,
      "end_frame": 1739,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Correct solution, but too much repeated range sum work.",
      "start_ms": 57980,
      "end_ms": 62920,
      "start_frame": 1739,
      "end_frame": 1888,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "So here is the question that matters.",
      "start_ms": 63560,
      "end_ms": 65720,
      "start_frame": 1907,
      "end_frame": 1972,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Can we get the sum of a range without rebuilding that range again?",
      "start_ms": 66560,
      "end_ms": 71420,
      "start_frame": 1997,
      "end_frame": 2143,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "That is exactly where prefix sums help us.",
      "start_ms": 72400,
      "end_ms": 75860,
      "start_frame": 2172,
      "end_frame": 2276,
      "word_count": 8
    }
  ],
